<Prose title="Disclaimer" desc="GovPulse is informational only and is not financial, investment or policy advice. Data may be revised, delayed or incomplete." template>
<h2>Not financial advice</h2><p>GovPulse is for general information. It is not financial, investment, tax, legal or policy advice, and it is not a recommendation to buy or sell anything. Consult a qualified professional before making decisions.</p>
<h2>Data accuracy</h2><p>Indicators come from third parties, mainly the World Bank World Development Indicators. Official statistics are often annual, published with a 1 to 2 year lag, and revised later. Each figure shows its data year and source update date. We do not guarantee completeness or accuracy.</p>
<h2>Claim checks</h2><p>Claim wording on claim-check cards is a generic template, not a quote from any person or party. The cards present data side by side; they do not judge anyone's intent.</p>
<h2>Sample content</h2><p>Items labelled SAMPLE (such as the policy feed and daily brief) are placeholders, not real events.</p>
<h2>Media</h2><p>Background photos and videos illustrate places and industries. They do not imply endorsement by their authors or by the institutions shown.</p>
</Prose>
